WEBVTT

00:14:26.861 --> 00:14:30.049
jer joj je živac u licu oštećen,

00:14:30.049 --> 00:14:32.501
viđao sam tamnu sjenu

00:14:32.501 --> 00:14:38.038
kako se širi licem moje žene.

00:14:38.038 --> 00:14:44.139
Ali moja kćer se nikad nije žalila.

00:14:44.139 --> 00:14:46.200
Rekla bi nam,

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:48.251
"Sviđa mi se moj iskrivljeni osmijeh

00:14:48.251 --> 00:14:50.993
i neosjetljivost u licu.

00:14:50.993 --> 00:14:53.072
Bit ću dobro. Molim vas ne brinite."

00:14:53.072 --> 00:14:55.201
Bila nam je utjeha,

00:14:55.201 --> 00:14:58.098
i tješila nas je.